+//
+// One joystick per player: Npad No1 to No4 (the four ports of a GameCube),
+// the console's attached Joy-Cons counting as player 1. Each is added when a
+// controller connects to its Npad and removed when it leaves, with the Npad's
+// number as its player index, so player N stays player N whatever connects
+// first. A change of controller style on an Npad (a Joy-Con pair split in
+// two, a Pro Controller replacing it) removes the joystick and adds it again.
